## Context

Migrate the 10 August 2026 pilot to the 0716 contract, retrieve the full RMP
and the missing decision texts, then update all sources up to the collection
date. The 24 projects / USD 7.04 bn of July 2025 must be distinguished from the
17 filtered new proposals.

## Test

The migration keeps the 66 manifest lines and the 46 ground-truth observations
with no loss of provenance. A dedicated check rejects any confusion between 24
total projects and 17 new proposals and requires an explicit verdict for the
RMP, decisions 1009/458/1929 and the MOIT portal newsletters up to the last
observed issue.

## Exit criteria

- [x] Pilot manifest and ground truth migrated without loss
- [x] RMP, decisions and MOIT newsletters collected or blocker documented
- [x] The 24 records are tracked: 3 named projects at their funders and 21 unpublished identities without an invented name
- [x] ADB/BII are covered by direct page, IATI or explicit absence
- [x] Vietnam coverage check passes
